&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tekion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Positively disrupting an industry that has not seen any innovation in over 50 years, Tekion has challenged the paradigm with the first and fastest cloud-native automotive platform that includes the revolutionary Automotive Retail Cloud (ARC) for retailers, Automotive Enterprise Cloud (AEC) for manufacturers and other large automotive enterprises and Automotive Partner Cloud (APC) for technology and industry partners. Tekion connects the entire spectrum of the automotive retail ecosystem through one seamless platform. The transformative platform uses cutting-edge technology, big data, machine learning, and AI to seamlessly bring together OEMs, retailers/dealers and consumers. With its highly configurable integration and greater customer engagement capabilities, Tekion is enabling the best automotive retail experiences ever. Tekion employs close to 3,000 people across North America, Asia and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Software Architect (Frontend)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Software Architect – Frontend is responsible for leading the design, architecture, and implementation of modern, scalable, and maintainable frontend applications across our product suite. This role collaborates cross-functionally with designers, backend engineers, and product managers to ensure a seamless and consistent user experience, driving the adoption of best practices in frontend engineering and staying abreast of the latest technology trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, design, and document the architecture for frontend applications, ensuring scalability, performance, accessibility, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce the use of frontend development best practices, frameworks, and design patterns across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with UX/UI designers to translate design concepts into functional, pixel-perfect user interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with backend engineers to design and implement robust APIs and data integration strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance and mentorship to frontend development teams, conducting code reviews and promoting a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize frontend performance for various browsers and devices, proactively identifying bottlenecks and areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and select technologies, frameworks, and tools to support the evolving needs of the frontend platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cross-team architectural initiatives and promote reusability across web and mobile solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with emerging trends in frontend development, evaluating their relevance and potential impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain thorough documentation of frontend architecture, workflows, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional frontend development experience, including significant experience in architectural or lead roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in JavaScript, TypeScript, HTML5, CSS3, and modern frontend frameworks (e.g., React, Angular, Vue.js).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting and building large-scale, high-performance web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of web performance, security, accessibility standards (e.g., WCAG), and responsive design principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with state management solutions, component-based architecture, and modular design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with backend integration, RESTful APIs, and micro frontends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in build tools (e.g., Webpack, Babel), testing frameworks, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, leadership, and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile or cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile web or hybrid app development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of UI/UX best practices and collaboration with design systems teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source frontend projects or active involvement in frontend technology communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with internationalization, localization, and accessibility compliance in web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using AI tools (Augment, Cursor, Claude Code)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with some of the smartest minds to solve complex challenges at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Impactful role in shaping and securing a global, cloud-native &amp;amp; AI driven platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Innovative, collaborative, and fast-paced culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Current Tekion Employees – Please apply via Greenhouse Internal Job Board&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tekion is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, victim of violence or having a family member who is a victim of violence, the intersectionality of two or more protected categories, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information on our privacy practices, please refer to our Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; href=&quot;https://tekion.com/legal/privacy/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tekion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Positively disrupting an industry that has not seen any innovation in over 50 years, Tekion has challenged the paradigm with the first and fastest cloud-native automotive platform that includes the revolutionary Automotive Retail Cloud (ARC) for retailers, Automotive Enterprise Cloud (AEC) for manufacturers and other large automotive enterprises and Automotive Partner Cloud (APC) for technology and industry partners. Tekion connects the entire spectrum of the automotive retail ecosystem through one seamless platform. The transformative platform uses cutting-edge technology, big data, machine learning, and AI to seamlessly bring together OEMs, retailers/dealers and consumers. With its highly configurable integration and greater customer engagement capabilities, Tekion is enabling the best automotive retail experiences ever. Tekion employs close to 3,000 people across North America, Asia and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Job Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Software Platform Architect is responsible for the high-level design, development, and evolution of scalable software platforms that support multiple products and business needs. This role collaborates with cross-functional teams—including engineering, product, and operations—to define technology standards, guide architectural decisions, and ensure the platform’s reliability, scalability, and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Role and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the architecture and design of Integration and System Integrator Platform platforms, ensuring alignment with business objectives and technical strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and promote the use of architectural patterns, best practices, and standards across the engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with development teams to translate business requirements into robust, scalable, and modular solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and select appropriate technologies, frameworks, and tools to meet platform needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee integration with internal and third-party systems, ensuring data integrity and optimal performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct architecture reviews and provide technical guidance to engineering teams throughout the software development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address potential bottlenecks, vulnerabilities, and system failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation of architecture, processes, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging technologies and industry trends, evaluating their potential impact on the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and coach engineering teams on architectural principles and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or master&#39;s degree in computer science, Software Engineering, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building at event driven applications at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant experience in software development and architecture, with a focus on building platforms or large-scale systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience is large scale messaging systems like Kafka&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Mongodb, ElasticSearch, MySQL, Postgresql&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in building platform components using the java, SpringBoot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, GCP) and container orchestration (e.g., Kubernetes, Docker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of APIs, microservices, data storage, and integration methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS platform architecture or development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DevOps practices and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with security, compliance, and regulatory requirements for enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, communication, and leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using AI tools (Augment, Cursor, Claude code)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical Insurance coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with some of the brightest minds from Silicon Valley’s most dominant and successful companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tekion is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, victim of violence or having a family member who is a victim of violence, the intersectionality of two or more protected categories, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information on our privacy practices, please refer to our Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; href=&quot;https://tekion.com/legal/privacy/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tekion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Positively disrupting an industry that has not seen any innovation in over 50 years, Tekion has challenged the paradigm with the first and fastest cloud-native automotive platform that includes the revolutionary Automotive Retail Cloud (ARC) for retailers, Automotive Enterprise Cloud (AEC) for manufacturers and other large automotive enterprises and Automotive Partner Cloud (APC) for technology and industry partners. Tekion connects the entire spectrum of the automotive retail ecosystem through one seamless platform. The transformative platform uses cutting-edge technology, big data, machine learning, and AI to seamlessly bring together OEMs, retailers/dealers and consumers. With its highly configurable integration and greater customer engagement capabilities, Tekion is enabling the best automotive retail experiences ever. Tekion employs close to 3,000 people across North America, Asia and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Job Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need an Associate Principal Graphic Designer who can think strategically and ship great work. You&#39;ll manage our brand&#39;s visual identity across all digital channels and work directly with the communication team, marketing, and leadership to create designs that connect with our audience. You&#39;ll mentor the design team, maintain quality standards, and help build the way we work. This role fits someone who wants to lead, create, and grow a design practice at a technology company that moves fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Role and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand Vision &amp;amp; Consistency: You&#39;ll maintain our brand&#39;s visual standards and build the design systems that keep everything consistent. That means creating guidelines, components, and patterns that work across all platforms - so every project reinforces the brand without starting from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Creative Leadership: You&#39;ll own design projects from start to finish across web, mobile, and marketing campaigns. That means taking concepts from initial ideas through final launch. You&#39;ll work with communications, marketing, product, and leadership to create designs that look sharp and move business metrics - whether that&#39;s revenue, adoption, or conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideation &amp;amp; Storytelling: You&#39;ll research concepts and turn them into working designs. Then you&#39;ll present your work to different teams - product, marketing, leadership - and explain the thinking behind your JD - Associate Principle Graphic Designer 1 choices. That means showing why certain design decisions solve specific problems, not just what looks good. You need to make your case clearly whether you&#39;re talking to designers or marketers or executives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Growth: You&#39;ll manage a small design team and help them grow. That means coaching designers on their projects, giving feedback that improves their work, and building accountability around quality. The goal is creating a design powerhouse where people own their craft and keep getting better at it. Holistic Design Oversight: You&#39;ll review all design work before it ships - product interfaces, illustrations, brand materials, presentations, and campaign visuals. That means maintaining quality standards across everything and making sure it all feels consistent. Nothing goes out without your approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Workflow Innovation: You&#39;ll build design systems and workflows that make the team more efficient. As we grow, you&#39;ll keep improving how we work - finding ways to move faster without dropping quality. The goal is scaling output while keeping the work sharp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Design Advocacy: You&#39;ll represent design in leadership meetings and cross-functional discussions. That means explaining design decisions to executives and showing how they connect to business goals - whether that&#39;s Brand perception, revenue, adoption, or user retention. You&#39;ll need to make the case for design quality and user experience when priorities compete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1035&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7bdc1d19584f&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9+ years of hands-on visual and brand design experience in tech or SaaS, with a portfolio that shows clear thinking, strong storytelling, and high craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading or managing designers on real projects, with experience owning outcomes, not just visuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite, plus comfort exploring new tools for motion, prototyping, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and evolve brand identities, logos, and web experiences that can scale across enterprise audiences and channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with real executive presence: you can defend your work with clarity, invite feedback, and align teams around a shared vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running projects end to end, from brief and discovery through delivery, with a structured approach to planning, prioritizing, and followthrough.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A habit of staying ahead of design, product, and culture trends, and turning that curiosity into concrete ideas we can ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High personal accountability: you take ownership, push for better outcomes, and hold yourself and others to a strong quality bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine passion for design and storytelling, and a desire to grow a small team into a tight, proud, high-performing creative group.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical Insurance coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with some of the brightest minds from Silicon Valley’s most dominant and successful companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Tekion is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, victim of violence or having a family member who is a victim of violence, the intersectionality of two or more protected categories, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information on our privacy practices, please refer to our Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; href=&quot;https://tekion.com/legal/privacy/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tekion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Positively disrupting an industry that has not seen any innovation in over 50 years, Tekion has challenged the paradigm with the first and fastest cloud-native automotive platform that includes the revolutionary Automotive Retail Cloud (ARC) for retailers, Automotive Enterprise Cloud (AEC) for manufacturers and other large automotive enterprises and Automotive Partner Cloud (APC) for technology and industry partners. Tekion connects the entire spectrum of the automotive retail ecosystem through one seamless platform. The transformative platform uses cutting-edge technology, big data, machine learning, and AI to seamlessly bring together OEMs, retailers/dealers and consumers. With its highly configurable integration and greater customer engagement capabilities, Tekion is enabling the best automotive retail experiences ever. Tekion employs close to 3,000 people across North America, Asia and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Job Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leads cross-functional teams to define and execute product strategies that align with business objectives and customer needs across Tekion&#39;s Service (Fixed Ops) product portfolio. Oversees the product lifecycle from ideation to launch, ensuring products - including AI-native agents and intelligent workflows across the service and repair order lifecycle - deliver measurable value and drive company growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops and communicates a clear product vision and strategy for the Service portfolio that aligns with company goals and the economics of dealership Fixed Ops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzes market trends, customer feedback, and the competitive landscape to inform product decisions and sharpen differentiation against legacy DMS providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defines and ships AI-native products and agents while establishing clear frameworks for when AI should inform, decide, execute, or ask/escalate to a human and partners with Data Science and Engineering to move from prototype to trustworthy, production-grade capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishes and monitors key performance indicators (KPIs) - adoption, engagement, satisfaction, and revenue - to measure product success and inform future strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborates with cross-functional teams, including engineering, design, marketing, and business, to bring products to market effectively and drive adoption and monetization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns the commercial case for the product area: pricing, packaging, and the path to ARR growth to ensure every initiative carries a clear hypothesis and path to revenue or operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives continuous improvement in the product development lifecycle (PDLC) process, ensuring timely value delivery of high-quality products across scheduling, repair order, warranty, invoicing, and customer communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads, mentors, and manages a team of product managers, fostering professional growth and a high-performance, ownership-driven culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates with a high degree of autonomy. Reports to senior leadership and is accountable for product performance, business outcomes, and alignment with company goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2144&quot; data-local-id=&quot;07540d2d91bd&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in product management, with a track record of successfully executing on product strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2144&quot; data-local-id=&quot;07540d2d91bd&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in leading and managing a large product team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7c084523c236&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Computer Science, Engineering, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2418&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2c073230aea6&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building AI/ML-powered products and shipping trustworthy AI into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2518&quot; data-local-id=&quot;493b9f785d89&quot;&gt;Strong commercial and business instincts - comfort with pricing, packaging, business cases, and tying product to revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2643&quot; data-local-id=&quot;df963bc874cb&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to translate market insights into actionable product plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2743&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4a9b592e08e9&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to influence stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2854&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1837cab2485f&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Agile methodologies and product development tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2953&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0b0bb60630a9&quot;&gt;MBA or advanced degree in Product Design or Product Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3020&quot; data-local-id=&quot;236ca50e6536&quot;&gt;Recognized as a thought leader within the organization and industry, ideally with credibility in automotive retail, dealership operations, or adjacent vertical B2B ERP SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b2620fc56693&quot;&gt;Experience building work order management platform products including workflow builder, complex task routing, invoicing, taxation, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with some of the smartest minds to solve complex challenges at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impactful role in shaping and securing a global, cloud-native &amp;amp; AI driven platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
