&lt;p&gt;Own Product Strategy &amp;amp; Outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end product lifecycle for core Tekion CRM capabilities - from discovery and definition to launch, adoption, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve the product strategy and roadmap, aligned with company goals, customer needs, and platform vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive Business Impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption, penetration, and customer satisfaction for Tekion CRM, with clear accountability for usage, conversion, and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM and Customer Success teams to ensure features translate into real dealer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer-Centric Product Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the voice of the customer, deeply understanding dealership workflows, sales processes, and lifecycle needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously gather and synthesize customer feedback, usage data, and market insights to inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data-Driven Decision Making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics and KPIs for your product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to prioritize investments, evaluate trade-offs, and guide iteration post-launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex initiatives across Engineering, Design, Data, Marketing, and Customer Success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align stakeholders across product verticals to ensure roadmap coherence and platform consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Scale Thinking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions that scale across dealership sizes, regions, and OEM requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance speed with quality, ensuring solutions are configurable, extensible, and sustainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Product Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide Product Managers, setting a high bar for product thinking, execution, and customer empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product best practices, planning rituals, and decision-making frameworks across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Execution with Velocity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable teams to move fast without breaking things - clarifying priorities, managing dependencies, and making informed trade-offs to hit both short-term goals and long-term bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of Product Management experience owning customer-facing SaaS products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience mentoring or managing Product Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree (MBA or Engineering) from a top-tier institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading distributed onshore and offshore teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with ability to operate in complex, multi-stakeholder environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving product adoption and measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with Engineering, Design, Data, and GTM teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritization skills and ability to align stakeholders across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on product leader with strong judgment and bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end ownership of the product lifecycle, including post-launch iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable systems and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ ML product management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the automotive retail industry or with dealer/ OEM data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
