&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ABOUT TEKION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:11846400,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Tekion is a high-growth, cloud-native enterprise software company transforming the automotive retail industry through its ARC platform — the industry&#39;s first cloud-native DMS and AI-powered suite of dealer solutions. Backed by leading investors and serving dealerships across North America and beyond, Tekion is redefining how dealers operate, sell, service, and engage customers. Our CIO org drives internal technology innovation, building&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;and tools that power Tekion&#39;s post-sales delivery ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
