&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical Insurance coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with some of the brightest minds from Silicon Valley’s most dominant and successful companies&lt;/li&gt;
