ely resolves technical challenges in production and development environments. ​&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ​5–7 years of experience in software engineering&lt;br&gt;• ​Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field&lt;br&gt;• ​Expertise in one or more modern programming languages (e.g., Java, Python, JavaScript, C++)&lt;br&gt;• ​Strong understanding of distributed systems, cloud-native services, and performance optimization&lt;br&gt;• ​Experience with microservices, containerization (e.g., Docker, Kubernetes), and cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, GCP, Azure)&lt;br&gt;• ​Excellent problem-solving, mentorship, and communication skills&lt;br&gt;• ​Proven track record of delivering production-grade software and improving team effectiveness&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
